---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const values=[['Practical innovation','Choose technology for the problems it can solve, not novelty alone.'],['Security and responsibility','Consider security, access and risk as part of implementation.'],['Integrity and transparency','Be clear about scope, assumptions, responsibilities and limitations.'],['Customer-focused delivery','Keep requirements and the people using the systems in view.'],['Continuous learning','Stay curious as tools, risks and business needs evolve.'],['Long-term value','Consider maintainability and ownership alongside the initial decision.']];
---
<BaseLayout title="About Overdott Technologies | Our Approach and Values" description="Learn about Overdott Technologies Limited's purpose, mission and practical approach to technology solutions in Kenya.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="page-width page-hero-inner"><p class="eyebrow">About Overdott</p><h1>Technology should make work clearer, safer and more connected.</h1><p>Overdott Technologies Limited helps organizations explore, implement and manage practical technology solutions.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section page-width"><div class="image-copy"><div><p class="eyebrow">Our purpose</p><h2>Practical technology, considered as a whole.</h2><p>Organizations rely on connected infrastructure, secure access, useful software and digital channels. Overdott brings these needs into one conversation, from technology sourcing and integration to digital development and support.</p><p>Our approach is to understand the requirement first, explain options clearly and agree on work that fits the engagement.</p></div><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519389950473-47ba0277781c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" alt="Technology and business requirements being reviewed together" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900" /></div></section>
  <section class="section section-tint"><div class="page-width split-list"><div class="list-block"><p class="eyebrow">Our mission</p><h2>Help businesses use technology effectively.</h2><p>To help businesses adopt, integrate and use technology effectively through practical solutions, dependable technical services and a commitment to security, usability and long-term value.</p></div><div class="list-block"><p class="eyebrow">Our vision</p><h2>Build trust through useful technology.</h2><p>To become a trusted technology solutions and integration partner for businesses in Kenya and, over time, across Africa.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section page-width"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Our values</p><h2>How we approach the work.</h2><p>These principles guide how we scope recommendations, communicate and consider what happens after implementation.</p></div><div class="values-grid">{values.map(([title,description])=><div class="value-item"><h3>{title}</h3><p>{description}</p></div>)}</div></section>
  <section class="cta-band"><div class="page-width cta-inner"><div><h2>Start with the outcome you need.</h2><p>Tell us what you are trying to solve, and we'll explore practical next steps.</p></div><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button button-light" href="/contact/">Contact Overdott <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>